ll"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le10ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le10ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le10ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le10ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "V ...<br/><br/>\nSo here's what happened yesterday! Ms. Ryan has been planning this dinner for some friends. One of them fancies herself a chef. Well it seems this chef friend was working out at the gym. She didn't warm up, so she strained a muscle in her leg. Then she went on the crosstrainer to keep at it instead of stopping and banged her knee. Her gym trainer played up to her, telling her she could work through the pain."}, {"time": "26000", "image": "engenn8le10ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "So, she's on the treadmill, when she trips, gets thrown off, hits the wall, breaks her arm and passes out! Needless to say, she ended up in the hospital!\nMs. Ryan was shouting, \u2018Oh my party!'. <br/>I'm all - This can be solved easily. I could make a few calls. Then everything would be straightened out. I would suggest a venue I know of.  Your party can easily be saved! I'd recommend you make up a list of guests to contact. Someone could be asked to call them."}, {"time": "56000", "image": "engenn8le10ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "It would also be a good idea to rent a couple of limos to pick them up. That way they could be driven to and from the venue.\n<br/>\nShe's all  - Could you recommend a limo service too?<br/>\nI'm all - Consider it done.<br/>\nSo I've booked 25  for Spicy Rice Night! <br/><br/>\nSal"}]}}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Cooking Accident", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Sally to the Rescue", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe  events through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Modal Verbs in the Passive Voice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modal verbs to add meaning to other verbs. They come before the dictionary form (Infinitive without \u2018to') of the main verb.  Modal verbs can add meaning connected with certainty or obligation.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use modal verbs in the passive voice. <br/> You use the passive voice when you want to focus on the receiver of the action, rather than the \u2018doer' of the action. <br/><br/>  Here is the structure of a passive sentence:<br/><br/>  Subject + To be + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/>  <span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">is solved</span> easily.</span><br/><br/>   You can add a modal verb before the To be.<br/><br/>  Subject + modal + To be + past participle<br/><br/>  For example:<br/>  <span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">can be solved</span> easily.</span><br/><br/>  Here the sentence now has an additional meaning of possibility, thanks to the modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This can be solved easily.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Then everything would be straightened out.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Your party can easily be saved!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Someone could be asked to call them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That way they could be driven to and from the venue. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Inseparable Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use inseparable phrasal verbs to describe actions that can lead to injuries or accidents.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Usually the accident or injury happens because the person did not do something to ensure that it did not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">She didn't <span class=\"strong\">warm up</span>, so she strained a muscle in her leg. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Meaning</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">warm up<br/><br/>    keep at<br/><br/>  play up to<br/><br/>  work through<br/><br/>   end up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"do stretches and gentle exercises to get your muscles ready to work out<br/><br/>  continue doing <br/><br/> flatter<br/><br/>  continue, ignoring the problem<br/><br/>  finish\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Then she went on the crosstrainer to <span class=\"strong\">keep at</span> it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Then she went on the crosstrainer to keep at it.  Her gym trainer<span class=\"strong\"> played up to</span> her.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She told her she could <span class=\"strong\">work through</span> the pain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Needless to say, she <span class=\"strong\">ended up</span> in the hospital!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to work out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do physical exercises, as in training", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Well, it seems this chef friend was working out at the gym.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a mishap at the gym.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to warm up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to exercise in preparation before a game ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She didn't warm up, so she strained a muscle in her leg.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to keep at", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to carry on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She went on the crosstrainer to keep at it instead of stopping.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to play up to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to court; fawn over someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Her gym trainer played up to her.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to straighten out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to improve something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Then everything would be straightened out.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "consider it done", "type": "name"}, {"content": "this will be done for you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's all  - Could you recommend a limo service too? I'm all - Consider it done!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Get into groups. Brain storm all the different types of parties.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide on a party type and organize an event for the class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use modals of suggestion to help make your decision.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain in detail all the things you will have at your party.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a short 2-4 minute presentation to the rest of the class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The class votes on the best party idea.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I brainstorm different types of parties.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use modals of suggestion to help make a decision on which parties I wish to organize.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a short persuasive presentation.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}